    <cbc:Name languageID="ENG">Framework agreement for consultancy services within procurement consultancy services.</cbc:Name>
    
    <cbc:Description languageID="ENG">The main aim of this procurement is to establish a flexible framework agreement that ensures Fjellinjen access to the necessary capacity and expertise within public procurements.

A framework agreement will be signed with one tenderer, with a duration of four years. The estimated total value for the contract period is NOK 2-4 million excluding VAT. 

Fjellinjen currently has a separate framework agreement for lawyer services that are primarily used for legal assistance. However, it may be necessary to use this new framework agreement for legal assistance for procurements as needed.

</cbc:Description>
